WEBVTT

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:11.820
Now that Misael has come here,

00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:13.570
we can't afford to fail again.

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:18.220
If we fail the next time, it will be our end.

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:20.080
What should we do, Alit?

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:22.050
Isn't that quite obvious?

00:00:22.310 --> 00:00:23.650
A head-on showdown!

00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:26.920
I'll defeat Astral and Yuma Tsukumo!

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:29.020
A head-on showdown?!

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:32.910
Do you even know what that means?! If we lose-

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:35.110
I know! Of course I know!

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:39.480
But that doesn't matter!

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:44.560
I want to Duel that guy with everything
 at stake and beat him at full power!

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:46.880
Alit, you...

00:00:51.710 --> 00:00:52.540
Alit...

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:04.310
Yuma Tsukumo.

00:01:07.570 --> 00:01:08.850
You have no clue!

00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:12.420
You don't understand at all!

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:14.620
Hold it, Yuma!

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:17.820
Just how long are you going to eat?!

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:20.540
You'll be late! Late!

00:01:21.140 --> 00:01:22.600
Sh... shoot!

00:01:24.820 --> 00:01:26.170
I'm off!

00:01:26.680 --> 00:01:30.480
Goodness... He's become even more stupid ever since they let him out of the hospital.

00:01:31.160 --> 00:01:36.480
On the other hand, it's relieving to see him back to his foolish self.

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:37.710
I guess.

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:44.910
Yuma-<i>kun</i>!

00:01:46.110 --> 00:01:47.450
Oh! Shingetsu!

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:49.340
You're returning to school today, right?

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:50.880
I've been really waiting for this!

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:53.200
Waiting, huh? You'll be late now!

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:55.170
Huh?

00:01:58.000 --> 00:01:59.260
Wha... What's going on?

00:02:11.800 --> 00:02:13.400
What's up with those guys...?

00:02:14.740 --> 00:02:17.370
Yuma, they're all being controlled by Barian.

00:02:18.310 --> 00:02:19.170
Not good!

00:02:19.890 --> 00:02:21.800
<i>I won't let Shingetsu get involved in this...</i>

00:02:22.770 --> 00:02:24.280
Hey, let's run for it!

00:02:24.650 --> 00:02:25.910
Oh... Yes!

00:02:27.020 --> 00:02:30.620
Alit... I'll have to do things this way.

00:02:31.310 --> 00:02:35.570
To defeat Yuma Tsukumo and Astral for sure,

00:02:35.770 --> 00:02:37.310
and take away the Numbers.

00:02:39.570 --> 00:02:42.770
<i>The new enemies, Barians, have appeared in front of us!</i>

00:02:43.150 --> 00:02:45.970
<i>Their Chaos Xyz Monsters even can destroy Numbers.</i>

00:02:46.280 --> 00:02:50.280
<i>Plus, they're attacking us with their
 overwhelming Over Hundred Numbers!</i>

00:02:52.170 --> 00:02:54.800
<i>I can't lose to them! Let's go, Astral!</i>

00:02:55.800 --> 00:02:59.030
<i>I'm gonna bring it to 'em!</i>

00:03:01.380 --> 00:03:03.590
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:03:03.590 --> 00:03:09.560
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:12.270
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:03:22.070 --> 00:03:24.620
<i>Preparations for the fight are ready</i>

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:27.700
<i>I can already hear the shivering of my heart</i>

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:32.210
<i>Been waiting this whole time</i>

00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:34.580
<i>I may meet with defeat...</i>

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:37.800
<i>But that's exactly why I have to stand back up</i>

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:42.340
<i>Need to get stronger again</i>

00:03:42.510 --> 00:03:44.470
<i>It's good to believe</i>

00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:47.180
<i>The "now", more than ever before, is</i>

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:49.640
<i>but another limit to break down</i>

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:52.690
<i>I can cross with ease</i>

00:03:52.980 --> 00:03:55.150
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:03:55.150 --> 00:04:01.190
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:04:01.190 --> 00:04:03.950
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:04:03.990 --> 00:04:05.410
<i>Right here in my hand,</i>

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:10.120
<i>I'm holding a powerful trump card.</i>

00:04:10.240 --> 00:04:19.170
<i>With an unbreakable heart, I face toward my dream!</i>

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:34.000
Kotori-<i>san</i>.

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:41.130
"A Lightning Speed Counter Battle!
 Alit, The Determined Fighter!"

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:38.460
Rio-<i>san</i>! Good morning!

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:39.420
Good morning.

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:42.510
Isn't Yuma-<i>kun</i> going to school again today?

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:43.840
Yes.

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:47.470
But right now, he's probably running desperately
while yelling, "I'm gonna be late!"

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:53.890
Danger.

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:55.350
Huh? Rio-<i>san</i>?

00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:58.150
A group of enemies is approaching...

00:04:59.190 --> 00:05:00.650
Yuma is in danger!

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:01.820
What are you saying?!

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:03.030
Yuma is...?

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:22.880
Darn, we're surrounded!

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:24.760
Yu... Yuma-<i>kun</i>!

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:29.010
Do I have to fight so many opponents at once?!

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:33.060
<i>If I lose, Astral will...</i>

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:34.730
<i>What should I do?!</i>

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:38.190
Yuma!

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:42.610
Sha... Shark!

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:47.320
This is just right for my morning exercise.

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:49.200
Yuma! Astral!

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:52.030
Kotori-<i>san</i>! Rio-<i>san</i>!

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:54.450
I won't hold back!

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:56.460
I'll totally teach you a lesson!

00:05:56.660 --> 00:05:59.380
Thanks! I'm really grateful!

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:02.000
Here we go!

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:07.630
Duel Disk, set!

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:24.110
D-Gazer, set!

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:26.650
Duel!!

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:32.490
Ryouga and that sister of his... are a real pain.

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:36.370
In that case, I'll have to pull out my reserve!

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:40.210
Go, Big Jaws! Big Mouth!

00:06:45.760 --> 00:06:48.720
Hey, stop spacing out and come at me!

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:52.680
Go, Sylphine! Direct Attack!

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:02.400
And who will face me next?

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:07.150
Go, Gagaga Gunman! Direct Attack!

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:13.490
Hey, Shingetsu, are you alright?

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:16.580
Yuma-<i>kun</i>, sorry.

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:20.790
This is for the best...

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:23.920
You... don't tell me!

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:27.130
All for the Barian World.

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:29.590
Shingetsu? Hey, Shingetsu!

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:34.800
You're the one from back then!

00:07:35.810 --> 00:07:37.560
From the Sports Duel Tournament!

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:42.230
Why are you here?

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:45.770
Why? You still don't understand?

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:47.860
Then look at this card.

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:52.240
Yuma... This man must be a... Barian!

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:55.910
The... Then you made everyone do this?

00:07:56.120 --> 00:08:00.000
Right! My name is Gilag, the Warrior of Barian!

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:05.000
Now let's go, people! Crush Yuma Tsukumo and Astral to pulp!

00:08:13.010 --> 00:08:15.510
Come on, Summon your Monsters!

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:31.320
Yuma Tsukumo, Astral...

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:34.780
This will be the end of you guys!

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:37.200
Yuma!

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:41.620
This is bad, Yuma! 
If we receive attacks from all those Monsters at once...

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:46.040
Alright, attack Yuma Tsukumo directly!

00:08:55.840 --> 00:08:59.180
I activate the Quick-Play Magic, Lightning Clinch!

00:09:00.510 --> 00:09:01.270
Alit!

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:07.520
When I'm attacked, this card can be activated from my hand by paying 3000 Life Points,

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:09.480
and that battle is negated!

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:20.080
Alit!

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:23.700
Alit, are you okay?! Alit!

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:26.580
Impossible! Why're you here?

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:28.750
My turn.

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:31.250
Draw!

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:34.800
I activate a Magic Card, Brain Reboot!

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:39.140
With this card, if my Life Points are 1000 or lower,

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:42.850
all Monsters on the opponent's field go back to their hand,

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:46.100
and 500 times their levels is inflicted as damage!

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:12.840
Alit...

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:16.090
That power... Don't tell me he is...

00:10:17.170 --> 00:10:20.260
You bastard! Alit!!

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:23.760
Did you forget our mission?!

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:28.600
In order to save our world, we need the Numbers!

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:30.600
I haven't forgotten.

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:33.150
I <i>am</i> a Barian!

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:36.440
Barian?! You're a Barian, you said?!

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:44.580
Then why are you getting in my way?!

00:10:44.870 --> 00:10:49.170
I told you! I'll defeat him in a head-on showdown.

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:53.840
You're wrong! We're supposed to win by any means necessary!

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:56.460
Don't you underestimate Yuma Tsukumo!

00:10:56.760 --> 00:10:58.050
I'm not underestimating him!

00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:01.720
Because I acknowledge him as the best Duelist,

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:05.430
I'll defeat him in the best Duel and take his Numbers!

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:09.140
That's right... Before I'm a Barian, even...

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:10.480
...I am...

00:11:12.310 --> 00:11:14.360
...a Duelist!

00:11:15.860 --> 00:11:16.730
Alit...

00:11:17.570 --> 00:11:21.700
That's why I'll settle this with a Duel! Entirely with a Duel!

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:25.530
Gilag, what you did isn't Dueling at all!

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:27.540
Get outta here!

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:43.680
Duel with me.

00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:46.680
You accept, Yuma?

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:51.230
Wait... If we Duel you as a Barian, that means...

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:56.070
That's right. The Numbers...
 No, our very existence is at stake in this battle.

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:57.230
Alit...

00:11:57.900 --> 00:12:00.110
I just want to Duel you guys!

00:12:00.650 --> 00:12:02.320
Yuma, and Astral!

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:05.990
Alit... He can see Astral as well.

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:11.040
Yuma, his determination is unshakable.

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:14.540
Either way, he's an opponent we'll have to face eventually.

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:18.710
I understand... I'll do it.

00:12:19.590 --> 00:12:22.720
Since I accept this, together with Astral, I'll definitely win!

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:25.340
I've been waiting for those words!

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:29.180
Barian's Sphere Field, expand!

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:57.630
Alright, Yuma, let's Duel with all we have!

00:12:57.840 --> 00:13:00.130
Sure! Let's go, Alit!

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:02.300
Duel Disk, set!

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:05.180
Duel Disk, set!

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:11.270
D-Gazer, set!

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:16.810
Duel!!

00:13:25.400 --> 00:13:26.200
Alit...

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:30.240
Why are you a Barian? Why?!

00:13:30.870 --> 00:13:34.830
I'll go first! My turn! Draw!

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:38.380
I Summon Burning Knuckler Headgear!

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:48.050
Then, by giving up this turn's battle,

00:13:48.180 --> 00:13:50.800
I can Special Summon this guy from my hand!

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:53.770
Come forth, Burning Knuckler Spar!

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:58.440
To think he is taking advantage of the fact
that he can't attack on the first turn...

00:13:58.940 --> 00:14:02.980
I Overlay the Level Four Headgear and Spar!

00:14:04.490 --> 00:14:07.570
With these two Monsters, I build the Overlay Network!

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:09.200
Xyz Summon!

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:14.750
Come forth, Burning Knuckler - 
Restrained Barbaric Soldier, Leadblow!

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:18.170
Yuma, it's the same Monster as back then.

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:19.080
Yeah.

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:21.000
You already know, right?

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:26.380
By detaching one Overlay Unit,
 Leadblow cannot be destroyed by Battle.

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:32.010
Plus, every time it loses one Overlay Unit,
 it gains 800 Attack Points!

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:36.520
Not only can it not be destroyed by battle,
 but the Monster also gains Attack Power.

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:40.230
I set three cards.

00:14:40.350 --> 00:14:41.610
Turn end!

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:44.730
Those set cards!

00:14:45.190 --> 00:14:48.530
Is he trying to recreate the same situation as before?

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:51.570
Using countering counters.

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:55.740
The excitement that day's still etched into my body!

00:14:57.830 --> 00:15:01.130
He wants to settle this with the same strategy!

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:04.340
Come on! What will you be doing, Yuma?! Bring it!

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:08.510
Gotcha! I'm gonna do this, whatever strategy you pull off!

00:15:08.840 --> 00:15:11.300
My turn! Draw!

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:13.890
I Summon Gagaga Magician!

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:22.980
Then, when there is a Level Four or higher Gagaga Monster on my field,

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:26.020
I can Special Summon this guy from my hand!

00:15:26.650 --> 00:15:29.110
Come forth, Gagaga Kid!

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:33.740
Then Gagaga Kid's effect activates!

00:15:33.740 --> 00:15:39.500
When this card is Special Summoned, its level is changed to Level Four, the same as Gagaga Magician!

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:46.550
I Overlay the  Level Four Gagaga Magician and Gagaga Kid!

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:50.800
With these two Monsters, I build the Overlay Network!

00:15:51.260 --> 00:15:52.800
Xyz Summon!

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:58.600
Appear, Number 39! Aspiring Emperor - Hope!

00:16:01.190 --> 00:16:03.060
So you're here, Hope!

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:07.150
Then I set three cards!

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:11.900
So you're also trying to recreate the
 situation in that Duel back then.

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:13.110
Maybe.

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:15.870
With this, my turn end-

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:19.950
Wait! Before that happens,
 I activate the Quick-Play Magic, Overlay Flash!

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:20.870
What?!

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:23.670
A Quick-Play Magic at <i>this</i> timing?!

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:29.710
With this card, by detaching one Overlay Unit from an Xyz Monster on my field,

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:32.970
one opposing Monster's effects are negated!

00:16:37.010 --> 00:16:37.680
Hope!

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:41.060
Even as a Number, your Hope can be destroyed with this!

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:45.400
Additionally, since Leadblow loses an Overlay Unit,

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:48.020
its Attack Power rises 800 points!

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:52.110
He seems to have made his first move...

00:16:52.780 --> 00:16:55.860
One of the cards we just set is Fiery Fervor.

00:16:56.570 --> 00:16:59.280
When a opposing Monster's Attack Power increases,

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:02.410
our monster's Attack Power will be doubled.

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:06.460
But it was set this turn and can't be activated.

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:10.380
We have to allow Leadblow's increase of Attack Power.

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:13.800
I'll end my turn with this.

00:17:14.260 --> 00:17:17.590
Yuma, I will put everything I have into this Duel!

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:19.600
So you come at me with all you've got!

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:21.810
My turn! Draw!

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:25.270
I attack Hope with Leadblow!

00:17:26.650 --> 00:17:29.770
If this is a reproduction of that attack back then...

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:34.240
Alright! Trap, activate! Battle Rush!

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:39.280
During this Battle, my Monster cannot be destroyed, all the Battle Damage it receives is negated,

00:17:39.490 --> 00:17:42.370
and it inflicts damage to you equal to that amount!

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:45.210
So you really did use the same card as back then!

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:49.840
I activate the Counter Trap, Accel Footwork!

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:55.170
This card negates the effects of a Trap Card activated during the battle and destroys it!

00:17:56.760 --> 00:18:00.050
Then like last time, I will settle it with this card!

00:18:00.430 --> 00:18:03.720
Counter Trap, Xyz Cross, activate!

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:09.020
When Xyz Monsters battle while my
 opponent activates a Trap card,

00:18:09.310 --> 00:18:12.270
its activation and effects are negated!

00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:17.150
And I draw one card from my deck!

00:18:17.360 --> 00:18:19.570
If that card is a Monster Card,

00:18:19.820 --> 00:18:23.200
until the end of the battle,
 the Monsters' Attack Points are switched,

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:26.370
then the opponent's Monster's Attack Power is changed to zero!

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:31.540
That gave me some trouble last time,
 but that ain't happening this time!

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:36.210
I activate an additional Counter Trap, Counter's High!

00:18:36.590 --> 00:18:37.340
What?!

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:39.470
A new Counter?!

00:18:39.890 --> 00:18:45.060
This card negates the effects of a Counter Trap my opponent activates during battle!

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:51.860
And <i>then</i>, during this turn, 
the damage a player receives is doubled!

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:56.360
The difference of Attack Power is 500, thus your damage is 1000!

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:58.490
Go, Leadblow!

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:03.240
Pierce Yuma through Hope! Lightning Fast!

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:13.710
With this, I end my turn!

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:18.170
Awesome! Just awesome, Alit!

00:19:18.880 --> 00:19:22.050
Yup, I gotta go all out in a Duel with you or I'm in trouble!

00:19:22.510 --> 00:19:25.510
I'm so fired up and getting more and more excited!

00:19:26.010 --> 00:19:28.600
That's right, Yuma! Let's enjoy it!

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:33.560
Let's clash with all our power and enjoy this Duel with all our power!

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:35.610
Enjoying the Duel...

00:19:38.030 --> 00:19:40.780
Sure! I'll enjoy it with all my power!

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:42.610
My turn! Draw!

00:19:44.660 --> 00:19:47.830
I activate the Magic Card, Xyz Revenge!

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:53.330
With this card, if an Xyz Monster on my opponent's field has one or more Overlay Units,

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:58.380
I can Special Summon one Xyz Monster from my Graveyard!

00:19:58.670 --> 00:20:00.260
Come back, Hope!

00:20:01.510 --> 00:20:05.100
Then it grabs one Overlay Unit from an Xyz Monster my opponent controls,

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:07.510
and makes it the revived Hope's instead!

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:13.440
However, since Leadblow's Overlay Units decreased,

00:20:13.730 --> 00:20:16.360
it gains 800 Attack Power!

00:20:22.240 --> 00:20:25.910
Shoot! Leadblow's Attack Power has been increased once again!

00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:27.700
No, it's not over yet!

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:29.410
Yuma, now!

00:20:29.410 --> 00:20:30.040
Right!

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:33.500
I activate the Continuous Trap, Fiery Fervor!

00:20:34.370 --> 00:20:38.000
This card, when a opposing Monster's Attack Power increases,

00:20:38.550 --> 00:20:41.130
becomes our Monster's Equip Card,

00:20:41.550 --> 00:20:44.430
and the equipped Monster's Attack Power doubles!

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:50.680
Impossible! An Attack Power of... 5000?!

00:20:51.220 --> 00:20:55.310
Go, Hope! Attack Leadblow!

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:01.690
Hope Sword Double Flare Slash!

00:21:22.880 --> 00:21:25.130
Yuma, that's the way!

00:21:25.840 --> 00:21:28.090
No. The real match has just begun.

00:21:28.930 --> 00:21:31.260
This Duel is far from over.

00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:34.310
How... How can this be...

00:21:37.230 --> 00:21:40.690
Alit, our Duel's just getting started!

00:21:41.940 --> 00:21:42.780
Yeah...

00:21:44.240 --> 00:21:46.320
Here I go, Yuma!

00:21:46.820 --> 00:21:50.450
<i>Yuma... Alit... These two are attracted by each other.</i>

00:21:51.740 --> 00:21:54.040
<i>Just what will happen beyond this Duel...?</i>

00:21:59.080 --> 00:22:00.750
<i>This pain is...</i>

00:22:03.050 --> 00:22:05.920
<i>Indeed, this field is...!</i>

00:22:17.640 --> 00:22:24.530
<i>Does the thought "In any case..." following</i>

00:22:24.940 --> 00:22:32.200
<i>the foreboding premonition tell you to give up?</i>

00:22:32.200 --> 00:22:39.790
<i>Do you laugh at your dreams, saying "impossible"?</i>

00:22:39.790 --> 00:22:47.130
<i>You must find it funny that I'm not able to laugh at it, right?</i>

00:22:47.670 --> 00:23:04.070
<i>This song supports me, so I'll do my best for you this time.
 It's my turn to sing now.</i>

00:23:04.070 --> 00:23:08.860
<i>I will vow to you here</i>

00:23:08.860 --> 00:23:19.210
<i>As long as I live, you'll always be my tiny, little friend</i>

00:23:19.210 --> 00:23:27.760
<i>I'll erase all those little mistakes of yours</i>

00:23:27.760 --> 00:23:32.550
<i>Because I want to become an artist</i>

00:23:34.350 --> 00:23:38.850
<i>Look, I like doing it 'cuz it's fun.</i>

00:23:40.940 --> 00:23:43.310
The intense Duel between Alit and us continues.

00:23:43.860 --> 00:23:47.280
Finally his trump card appears, the Over Hundred Number!

00:23:47.780 --> 00:23:49.650
And suddenly, Astral is...

00:23:49.990 --> 00:23:51.950
Such a powerful Monster!

00:23:52.160 --> 00:23:54.160
Is this your true form?

00:23:54.160 --> 00:23:55.830
Just who will win in the end?

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:59.040
Let's go with our full strength! ZEXAL!

00:23:59.750 --> 00:24:01.670
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal II!

00:24:01.870 --> 00:24:05.750
"Roar, Chaos Number!
The Final Blow Towards Yuma!"

00:24:06.090 --> 00:24:08.460
This... is Alit's trump card!
